; Sample HLedger Journal for hledger-tui demonstration
; This journal contains example transactions showcasing various features

; === Account Declarations ===
account assets:checking           ; Main checking account
account assets:savings            ; Savings account
account assets:investments        ; Investment account
account liabilities:creditcard    ; Credit card
account expenses:food             ; Food and groceries
account expenses:utilities        ; Utilities (water, electricity, etc.)
account expenses:transport        ; Transportation costs
account expenses:entertainment    ; Entertainment and leisure
account expenses:home:rent        ; Rent payments
account expenses:home:utilities   ; Home utilities
account expenses:shopping         ; Shopping and clothing
account expenses:healthcare       ; Healthcare and medical
account expenses:financial        ; Banking fees and financial costs
account income:salary             ; Salary income
account budget:monthly            ; Monthly budget tracking

; === Tag Declarations ===
tag occasion
tag trip

; === Opening Balances ===
2025-01-01 * Opening Balances
    assets:checking              € 2500.00
    assets:savings               € 5000.00
    assets:investments           € 10000.00
    liabilities:creditcard       € -500.00
    equity:opening

